                        "entry_id": "312d7dee-04bb-36ec-afda-d9d756b080b7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Drollery, jesting, a funny saying or action."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c9a42986-631a-47d4-9bfc-b226a0a7206d",
                                "sense_id": "ffd9cfd4-2eda-3973-9265-6b39ffca373e",
                                "text": "For the funniments of the fair, I confess I have little relish. Springing a rattle, I always deemed something too serious for a joke; and no nautical gentleman ever yet laughed at having his back scratched."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "81256765-11ee-4c1e-91c8-460334e4b25d",
                                "sense_id": "ffd9cfd4-2eda-3973-9265-6b39ffca373e",
                                "text": "[…]; and at some of Barry’s funniments the Prince of Wales and his royal sister laughed[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7a21cb08-2b77-47dc-9a57-40ceb851409e",
                                "sense_id": "ffd9cfd4-2eda-3973-9265-6b39ffca373e",
                                "text": "His disguise as the Baron Mugwump also lent itself to much funniment."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "771212d4-b94a-4663-a895-635971525eef",
                                "sense_id": "ffd9cfd4-2eda-3973-9265-6b39ffca373e",
                                "text": "Therefore he has Berowne leave the stage first, lets Costard lag behind for a little solitary funniment, and then bolt after Berowne. If the funniment raises a laugh, that breaks contact, as it were, and continuity."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7577c739-49b6-421d-8673-95a2ed49eb6b",
                                "sense_id": "ffd9cfd4-2eda-3973-9265-6b39ffca373e",
                                "text": "Mrs. Levine, mother of former Councilman Arnold Levine, totes around an array of jokes and general funniments."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
